@ddd.domain-event

Purpose:
  Event representing a domain fact.

UseWhen:
  - other parts of system need to know about state change
  - decoupling producers from consumers
  - eventual consistency is acceptable

AvoidWhen:
  - synchronous operation required
  - internal-only state change

Why:
  Enables loose coupling between bounded contexts and modules.

Related:
  @ddd.bounded-context
  @architecture.event-driven

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
